<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mon Tableau de Bord - ERP</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background: #f5f7fa;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        .navbar {
            background: white;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .container-main {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .welcome-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .welcome-banner h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .welcome-banner p {
            font-size: 1rem;
            opacity: 0.95;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .info-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
        }

        .info-card h2 {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .info-card p {
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .button-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #5568d3;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: white;
            color: #667eea;
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: #667eea;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-danger {
            background: #ef4444;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-danger:hover {
            background: #dc2626;
            color: white;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .feature-item {
            background: #f9fafb;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .feature-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .feature-desc {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .restricted-notice {
            background: #fef3c7;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .restricted-notice h3 {
            color: #92400e;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .restricted-notice p {
            color: #78350f;
            margin: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <span class="navbar-brand mb-0 h1">
                <i class="bi bi-speedometer2"></i> ERP System
            </span>
            <div>
                <span class="text-muted me-3">{{ app.user.email }}</span>
                <a href="{{ path('app_logout') }}" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">
                    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i> Déconnexion
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container-main">
        <div class="welcome-banner">
            <h1>Bienvenue, {{ app.user.prenom }}!</h1>
            <p>Accédez à votre tableau de bord personnel</p>
        </div>

        <div class="restricted-notice">
            <h3>
                <i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> Accès Limited
            </h3>
            <p>En tant qu'utilisateur régulier, vous n'avez accès qu'à votre profil personnel. Pour accéder à l'administration complète, contactez un administrateur système.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
            <h2>Mes Informations</h2>
            <p>Voici les informations associées à votre compte:</p>
            
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-person-circle"></i></div>
                    <div class="feature-title">Nom</div>
                    <div class="feature-desc">{{ app.user.nom }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-person-badge"></i></div>
                    <div class="feature-title">Prénom</div>
                    <div class="feature-desc">{{ app.user.prenom }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i></div>
                    <div class="feature-title">Email</div>
                    <div class="feature-desc">{{ app.user.email }}</div>
                </div>
                {% if app.user.telephone %}
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon"><i class="bi bi-telephone"></i></div>
                    <div class="feature-title">Téléphone</div>
                    <div class="feature-desc">{{ app.user.telephone }}</div>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="button-group" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
                <a href="{{ path('app_home') }}" class="btn btn-primary">
                    <i class="bi bi-house"></i> Accueil
                </a>
                <a href="{{ path('app_logout') }}" class="btn btn-danger">
                    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i> Déconnexion
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-card">
            <h2><i class="bi bi-lock"></i> Tableau de Bord Administrateur</h2>
            <p>Vous pouvez accéder au tableau de bord administrateur complet avec gestion des utilisateurs, des produits et des catégories si vous disposez des droits d'administrateur.</p>
            <div class="button-group">
                <a href="{{ path('dashbord_index') }}" class="btn btn-primary">
                    <i class="bi bi-speedometer2"></i> Accéder au Tableau de Bord
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
